Kinematics-only model of the Isaac 6.2 asset
Robots/FourierIntelligence/GR-1/GR1T2_fourier_hand_6dof/GR1T2_fourier_hand_6dof.usd, the robot
spawned by GR1T2_CFG. Kit converts that USD at runtime for Pink; kitless Pink uses this copy.

Generated from the asset with SHA-256
4c10726748b53e431bcc80d5b872fd0457e5458ec2714f735e8940cfb25d4215 by Isaac Sim's
isaacsim.asset.exporter.urdf 2.2.10, through the same call Kit's Pink path makes, inside a
Kit application (for example after AppLauncher(headless=True)):

    isaaclab.controllers.utils.convert_usd_to_urdf(PickPlaceGR1T2EnvCfg().scene.robot.spawn.usd_path, out_dir)

followed by removing every link's <visual> and <collision> elements, which reference the
exported meshes, and adding this header. Regenerate it the same way whenever the asset changes;
source/isaaclab_tasks/test/contrib/test_teleop_task_assets.py checks its joints, limits and
forward kinematics against the spawned USD.
-->
